{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-borrow",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 190,
  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "borrow",
  "ipa": [
    "ˈbɒrəʊ"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "（向别人）借用；借"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This is a useful guidebook. I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "borrowed"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " it from the school library."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这是一本有用的指导手册。我从学校图书馆借来的。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "borrow 是常考单词，学生一定要掌握其意思，及比较与 lend, keep 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "borrow"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是向别人借用不属于自己的东西，表示“借进”，其结构是：borrow sb. sth. = borrow sth. from/of sb.，但不能与表示一段时间的状语连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "lend"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是将自己的东西借给别人使用，表示“借出”，其结构是：lend sb. sth. = lend sth. to sb.，但不能与表示一段时间的状语连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "keep"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 是表示“持有（某物）；保持（某种状态）”，可以与表示一段时间的状语连用。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
